---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";

import PhotoStrip from "../components/PhotoStrip.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <h1>Photography</h1>
  <p>
    I got my first camera in December before my big around the world trip for an
    unknown amount of time. I went and still going through a journey of
    exploration of photography and photo treatment. Software editing, photo
    printing, and zine designing.
  </p>
  <PhotoStrip />
  <h1>YouTube</h1>
  <p>
    I do a lot of experiments on YouTube, I would say video is an art form I
    feel very free and uncommitted to doing stuff a certain way. You will see a
    pretty wide variety of content from a 9th birthday electronic song to a
    hitchhiking in Japan vlog.
  </p>

  <div class="video-container">
    <iframe
      src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/3NQxxfJ3r6Q"
      title="YouTube video player"
      frameborder="0"
      allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
      allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>
</Layout>
